# Diabolic Edict targets a player. In response Bot2 casts Dawn's Truce (a Plains and a Mox Pearl), gaining hexproof, so the
# only target is illegal and Edict does not resolve (CR 608.2b): Bot2's Llanowar Elves is not sacrificed, and the countered
# Edict still goes to Bot1's graveyard.

